### ============================================
### GET ALL TERMS FOR SCHOOL
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/terms


### ============================================
### GET TERMS FOR ACADEMIC YEAR
### ============================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/terms/academic-year/{{academicYearId}}